01:06:24,510 --> 01:06:25,770
Imagine in the center here.

1088
01:06:26,270 --> 01:06:27,270
This could... Yo!

1089
01:06:27,830 --> 01:06:29,790
This could be my farming place.

1090
01:06:30,190 --> 01:06:32,670
Imagine coming up here and seeing fields of wheat.

1091
01:06:34,050 --> 01:06:38,030
You know, it's protected by wind from all angles here because of the mountains.

1092
01:06:41,510 --> 01:06:45,310
And then we built a tunnel through the mountain where we can have a railway.

1093
01:06:45,690 --> 01:06:47,970
And that railway goes across the water too.

1094
01:06:48,950 --> 01:06:49,770
Oh, no, no, no.

1095
01:06:49,830 --> 01:06:51,110
It goes underneath the water.

1096
01:06:51,750 --> 01:06:54,870
And it has like a glass tunnel.

1097
01:06:55,350 --> 01:06:58,890
So we can look at the water from underneath.

1098
01:07:00,810 --> 01:07:02,310
Oh, I need to do that.

1099
01:07:02,670 --> 01:07:04,350
In fact, I need to write that down right now.

1100
01:07:04,450 --> 01:07:06,510
That is the best idea I've had in a long time.

1101
01:07:09,550 --> 01:07:10,350
Let's see here.

1102
01:07:10,670 --> 01:07:11,570
Book of goals.

1103
01:07:15,380 --> 01:07:16,560
Okay, dude.

1104
01:07:17,160 --> 01:07:26,880
You gotta... Okay, south from main camp, there's a big ol' valley.

1105
01:07:27,260 --> 01:07:29,820
Pink flowers, all that.

1106
01:07:30,920 --> 01:07:43,900
You should make base there, and connect through a mountain with rails, and underneath...

1107
01:07:43,900 --> 01:07:44,340
Water.

1108
01:07:45,400 --> 01:07:45,840
Yeah!

1109
01:07:48,060 --> 01:07:49,540
Dude, that's hype.

1110
01:07:50,240 --> 01:07:51,120
That's really hype.

1111
01:07:51,520 --> 01:07:56,120
Also, I should not have my Silk Touch pickaxe equipped by default, because it sucks.

1112
01:07:56,320 --> 01:07:57,940
We don't want it to mine things, right?

1113
01:07:59,060 --> 01:08:01,660
But for removing end chest and all that, it's good.

1114
01:08:07,060 --> 01:08:08,520
Ah, man, I'm tempted to fly again.

1115
01:08:09,740 --> 01:08:10,620
I should just fly.

1116
01:08:11,800 --> 01:08:14,600
I can keep repairing, it's no problem, and I still have so many rockets.

1117
01:08:17,160 --> 01:08:21,880
I think I went along here last time, or maybe I went... I actually don't remember.

1118
01:08:26,540 --> 01:08:27,620
Uh-oh, uh-oh, uh-oh.

1119
01:08:28,240 --> 01:08:30,340
Soft landing, soft landing, soft landing.

1120
01:08:30,920 --> 01:08:32,200
I'm getting good at that!

1121
01:08:33,460 --> 01:08:34,780
Getting really good at that.

1122
01:08:38,900 --> 01:08:41,020
Man, I kind of want this to be my main base.

1123
01:08:41,220 --> 01:08:42,500
Like, it's so beautiful.

1124
01:08:43,520 --> 01:08:45,900
And look, we have caves everywhere around.

1125
01:08:46,280 --> 01:08:47,400
We could name them.

1126
01:08:47,620 --> 01:08:50,300
This could be the cave that looks like, you know.

1127
01:08:50,720 --> 01:08:52,120
And this could be another cave.

1128
01:08:52,260 --> 01:08:54,580
It could have names, signs on them, you know.

1129
01:08:56,060 --> 01:08:59,720
Just to, you know, signify the paths and all that.

1130
01:09:00,060 --> 01:09:00,480
Snow!

1131
01:09:02,640 --> 01:09:04,220
Okay, we're definitely on the right track.

1132
01:09:07,910 --> 01:09:08,950
And a village.

1133
01:09:12,790 --> 01:09:26,670
If I was here once... I would have gone towards the village, I think.

1134
01:09:30,750 --> 01:09:31,370
Yeah.

1135
01:09:33,570 --> 01:09:34,190
Fly!

1136
01:09:50,040 --> 01:09:51,300
Okay, park, park, park.

1137
01:09:52,320 --> 01:09:52,720
Careful.

1138
01:09:53,180 --> 01:09:53,420
Nice.

1139
01:09:57,340 --> 01:09:59,180
So I don't actually remember any of this.

1140
01:10:00,840 --> 01:10:02,360
Except that there was a lot of snow.

1141
01:10:08,080 --> 01:10:10,340
I think I would have kept going south, if anything.

1142
01:10:10,820 --> 01:10:12,160
Now, one thing is clear.

1143
01:10:12,300 --> 01:10:16,500
I haven't had any stutters yet from loading new areas.

1144
01:10:17,120 --> 01:10:18,780
So this is a good sign, right?

1145
01:10:20,820 --> 01:10:22,960
I'm meta-playing it a little bit here.

1146
01:10:29,300 --> 01:10:31,680
I remember this going on forever.

1147
01:10:32,020 --> 01:10:36,760
If this is this place I'm thinking of... Man, look at that cave.

1148
01:10:38,700 --> 01:10:40,900
Looks like a black hole in the middle of this, doesn't it?

1149
01:10:41,500 --> 01:10:42,940
I'm gonna fly to the top of that peak.

1150
01:10:46,600 --> 01:10:47,580
Through the clouds.

1151
01:10:48,080 --> 01:10:48,560
Ho-ho!

1152
01:10:55,320 --> 01:10:56,280
Can I land up here?

1153
01:10:56,740 --> 01:10:58,540
Oh, no, I don't have enough height.

1154
01:10:58,780 --> 01:10:58,920
Fuck.

1155
01:11:00,400 --> 01:11:01,840
Okay, park, park, park, park, park, park.

1156
01:11:02,900 --> 01:11:03,560
Okay, nice.

1157
01:11:09,400 --> 01:11:10,080
What is that?

1158
01:11:13,520 --> 01:11:15,160
Oh, that's an interesting building.

1159
01:11:15,160 --> 01:11:15,880
Look at that.

1160
01:11:19,660 --> 01:11:21,600
Is that a church or something?

1161
01:11:24,000 --> 01:11:25,420
Ooh, I remember this!

1162
01:11:26,420 --> 01:11:27,420
The Oasis!

1163
01:11:29,720 --> 01:11:32,940
That is a significant landmark.

1164
01:11:33,140 --> 01:11:33,940
I remember this.

1165
01:11:38,840 --> 01:11:41,700
Like a patch of green in the Winter Wonderland.

1166
01:11:42,820 --> 01:11:44,120
I think I even went there.

1167
01:11:49,250 --> 01:11:50,230
Guess we fly again.

1168
01:11:54,510 --> 01:11:56,230
Dude, I am so high up right now.

1169
01:11:59,570 --> 01:12:01,990
I'm just gonna coast for as long as I can right now.

1170
01:12:11,500 --> 01:12:13,660
The question is, where did I find the igloo?

1171
01:12:14,680 --> 01:12:18,440
I remember it being on a somewhat flat land.

1172
01:12:21,220 --> 01:12:21,740
Oh!

1173
01:12:22,900 --> 01:12:23,880
I've been there!

1174
01:12:24,780 --> 01:12:25,880
That is my work.

1175
01:12:31,020 --> 01:12:31,980
I've been there.

1176
01:12:42,970 --> 01:12:44,190
Village?

1177
01:12:44,810 --> 01:12:45,690
Ho!

1178
01:12:45,970 --> 01:12:46,570
No.

1179
01:12:52,820 --> 01:12:59,120
By the way, I had an idea earlier today regarding connecting all the different places in this world.

1180
01:12:59,760 --> 01:13:00,380
Excuse me?

1181
01:13:01,760 --> 01:13:02,560
What's happening here?

1182
01:13:03,800 --> 01:13:06,140
Hold on, hold on, hold on, hold on, hold on, hold on.

1183
01:13:07,400 --> 01:13:08,660
First, we gotta plop down a bit.

1184
01:13:11,520 --> 01:13:11,880
Save.

1185
01:13:12,680 --> 01:13:13,880
I'm so glad I just did that.

1186
01:13:14,960 --> 01:13:15,320
Great.

1187
01:13:20,920 --> 01:13:21,900
Alright, people!

1188
01:13:32,660 --> 01:13:33,380
Nice.

1189
01:13:34,880 --> 01:13:36,300
I'm protecting everyone.

1190
01:13:39,180 --> 01:13:40,520
Get inside your houses.

1191
01:13:41,340 --> 01:13:42,460
It's not safe.

1192
01:13:44,120 --> 01:13:45,160
What are they doing?

1193
01:13:52,760 --> 01:13:53,600
Where are you?

1194
01:13:55,980 --> 01:13:57,040
Where are you?

1195
01:13:59,440 --> 01:14:00,580
Oh, kitty cats!

1196
01:14:03,840 --> 01:14:04,760
Oh, I see them!

1197
01:14:04,960 --> 01:14:06,080
They're coming from this direction.

1198
01:14:10,620 --> 01:14:11,780
Look at this arrow here.

1199
01:14:13,260 --> 01:14:21,240
Oh, speaking of arrows... Shoot each other!

1200
01:14:27,870 --> 01:14:28,470
Fuck me!

1201
01:14:30,510 --> 01:14:32,590
That was way more damage than I thought it would be!

1202
01:14:35,030 --> 01:14:35,990
Okay, okay, it's fine.

1203
01:14:36,150 --> 01:14:36,550
Calm down.

1204
01:14:36,810 --> 01:14:37,390
Pick up the items.

1205
01:14:38,090 --> 01:14:39,610
I died over there.

1206
01:14:39,750 --> 01:14:40,370
I see it, I see it.

1207
01:14:42,370 --> 01:14:45,730
We're gonna sprint through, grab the items, lock ourselves in the house.

1208
01:14:48,750 --> 01:14:50,250
Okay, okay, okay, okay, okay, okay.

1209
01:14:51,110 --> 01:14:51,450
Go.

1210
01:14:56,640 --> 01:14:58,160
Take it all, take it all, take it all, take it all.

1211
01:14:58,820 --> 01:15:01,740
Shit, shit, shit, shit, shit, shit, shit, shit, shit, shit, shit.

1212
01:15:02,700 --> 01:15:03,520
We're leaving, we're leaving.

1213
01:15:05,240 --> 01:15:05,680
Uh-oh.

1214
01:15:09,120 --> 01:15:10,240
I don't dare look back.

1215
01:15:11,080 --> 01:15:11,940
They're coming for me.

1216
01:15:16,380 --> 01:15:17,160
Where's my gear at?

1217
01:15:28,960 --> 01:15:29,440
Okay.

1218
01:15:29,440 --> 01:15:29,920
Shield.

1219
01:15:30,800 --> 01:15:31,480
No shield.

1220
01:15:32,040 --> 01:15:32,400
There.

1221
01:15:33,400 --> 01:15:35,040
Okay, gotta go back, grab more.

1222
01:15:37,900 --> 01:15:38,380
Eat.

1223
01:15:40,160 --> 01:15:40,840
It's fine.

1224
01:15:41,740 --> 01:15:43,160
These guys are hardcore.

1225
01:15:50,280 --> 01:15:51,440
Give me that, give me that.

1226
01:15:51,960 --> 01:15:52,600
Chest, chest.

1227
01:15:52,940 --> 01:15:53,860
Oh yes, oh yes.

1228
01:16:00,380 --> 01:16:02,420
Maybe that's why I took so much damage, because I had Elytra on.

1229
01:16:06,640 --> 01:16:07,300
No, no, no.

1230
01:16:08,660 --> 01:16:09,600
Not right now, not right now.

1231
01:16:13,660 --> 01:16:14,700
Where's the raid bar?

1232
01:16:16,720 --> 01:16:17,640
Oh, no, did I fail?

1233
01:16:17,720 --> 01:16:18,240
Is everyone dead?

1234
01:16:19,080 --> 01:16:19,960
Oh, shit.

1235
01:16:30,820 --> 01:16:34,740
Oh, the way he's sprinting towards me... makes me very uncomfortable.

1236
01:16:38,920 --> 01:16:39,280
Headshot.

1237
01:16:41,800 --> 01:16:42,820
I think I failed them.

1238
01:16:43,000 --> 01:16:43,580
Everyone is dead.

1239
01:16:45,360 --> 01:16:46,060
Damn, dude.

1240
01:16:48,020 --> 01:16:49,980
Well, not like I knew them anyway, right?

1241
01:16:50,500 --> 01:16:52,420
It was the random-ass village in the middle of nowhere.

1242
01:16:53,540 --> 01:16:56,920
It was actually out of the goodness of my heart that I even stopped to help them, right?

1243
01:16:57,020 --> 01:16:58,620
I could have just kept flying, but nope.

1244
01:16:59,400 --> 01:17:01,780
The good Samaritan I am, I gave it my best shot.

1245
01:17:01,900 --> 01:17:04,560
In fact, I laid down my life and my experience points for it.

1246
01:17:09,950 --> 01:17:11,070
Oh, you're in here, right.

1247
01:17:13,550 --> 01:17:15,150
Oh, you're waiting!

1248
01:17:19,590 --> 01:17:19,990
Okay,

1249
01:17:23,270 --> 01:17:24,730
let's grab the bed and move on.

1250
01:17:24,850 --> 01:17:25,690
In fact, I'm just gonna sleep.

1251
01:17:26,550 --> 01:17:27,770
Get this knight over with.

1252
01:17:29,630 --> 01:17:30,230
Oh, shit.

1253
01:17:34,890 --> 01:17:35,290
Nice.

1254
01:17:35,650 --> 01:17:35,970
Good.

1255
01:17:36,550 --> 01:17:36,950
Cheers.

1256
01:17:42,560 --> 01:17:45,640
I'm so glad I remembered to put down the bed and sleep before that.

1257
01:17:46,860 --> 01:17:47,920
A plus move.

1258
01:17:50,840 --> 01:17:54,380
Could have been a real disaster, huh?

1259
01:18:02,300 --> 01:18:03,580
Did I get all my pouches?

1260
01:18:03,720 --> 01:18:05,460
One, two, three, four.

1261
01:18:05,760 --> 01:18:06,080
Nice!

1262
01:18:09,160 --> 01:18:09,680
Are we good?

1263
01:18:09,800 --> 01:18:10,020
Are we good?

1264
01:18:12,560 --> 01:18:12,880
Okay.

1265
01:18:14,340 --> 01:18:17,260
Which way is... home?

1266
01:18:19,240 --> 01:18:20,700
Okay, so this is the way we have to go.

1267
01:18:26,260 --> 01:18:30,120
Get rid of this and... Where's all my bread?

1268
01:18:35,150 --> 01:18:36,710
I had way more bread.

1269
01:18:39,550 --> 01:18:40,710
Where did it go?

1270
01:18:42,810 --> 01:18:46,210
Also, what is happening... here?

1271
01:18:51,210 --> 01:18:52,130
Wait a minute.

1272
01:18:54,750 --> 01:18:55,410
Hmm.

1273
01:18:56,230 --> 01:18:57,590
Okay, it looked suspicious.

1274
01:19:10,560 --> 01:19:11,480
Okay, I'll take this.

1275
01:19:13,360 --> 01:19:14,180
Good enough for me.

1276
01:19:18,940 --> 01:19:19,460
Oh, yeah.

1277
01:19:20,360 --> 01:19:21,120
Ooh, taters.

1278
01:19:26,340 --> 01:19:27,380
Everyone is dead anyway, right?

1279
01:19:27,520 --> 01:19:28,220
May as well loot them.

1280
01:19:31,310 --> 01:19:33,630
I do need these supplies for my trip.

1281
01:19:35,770 --> 01:19:36,830
Weird house!

1282
01:19:38,970 --> 01:19:39,950
Very weird.

1283
01:19:46,710 --> 01:19:50,450
This is the... like that.

1284
01:19:50,790 --> 01:19:51,470
That's how I had it.

1285
01:19:52,530 --> 01:19:55,670
Spyglass, bow, arrows check.

1286
01:19:56,050 --> 01:19:57,010
Okay, everything seems good.

1287
01:20:01,020 --> 01:20:02,340
Dirt is actually nice to have.

1288
01:20:05,420 --> 01:20:06,680
Backup shield, nice.

1289
01:20:06,940 --> 01:20:08,620
What about my... yeah, shulker box is there.

1290
01:20:09,540 --> 01:20:10,760
Everything else seems to be there.

1291
01:20:11,480 --> 01:20:11,920
Wonderful.

1292
01:20:12,740 --> 01:20:13,660
Okay, we're back.

1293
01:20:15,020 --> 01:20:16,280
Everything is okay.

1294
01:20:16,780 --> 01:20:18,620
We lost a little bit of levels, but it's fine.

1295
01:20:19,580 --> 01:20:20,560
Not the end of the world.

1296
01:20:22,280 --> 01:20:23,900
We're gonna get all that back for sure.

1297
01:20:25,480 --> 01:20:25,920
Also...

1298
01:20:36,850 --> 01:20:41,310
I'm looking for secret underground areas there.

1299
01:20:42,470 --> 01:20:47,830
I forgot if the igloo I found actually looked like this, or it looked like this.

1300
01:20:48,810 --> 01:20:49,970
Like that color.

1301
01:20:51,130 --> 01:20:52,790
Speaking of that igloo...

1302
01:20:58,370 --> 01:20:59,530
This seems flat.

1303
01:20:59,910 --> 01:21:02,650
This could be very close to where I found the igloo.

1304
01:21:03,790 --> 01:21:05,450
I remember things being flat.

1305
01:21:06,870 --> 01:21:07,770
Get rid of this.

1306
01:21:16,770 --> 01:21:19,090
Okay, looks like Winter Wonderland is ending.

1307
01:21:21,760 --> 01:21:22,740
I gotta fly.

1308
01:21:24,380 --> 01:21:25,220
Let's have a look.

1309
01:21:26,040 --> 01:21:28,040
Fucking... Get it out of there.

1310
01:21:32,220 --> 01:21:33,080
Eat first.

1311
01:21:44,220 --> 01:21:45,060
Is that it?

1312
01:21:46,520 --> 01:21:48,260
That looks like it.

1313
01:21:49,240 --> 01:21:51,040
It was right on the border of green.

1314
01:21:53,080 --> 01:21:54,400
That is it for sure.

1315
01:21:57,420 --> 01:21:58,160
Pit stop.

1316
01:21:58,980 --> 01:21:59,640
Pit stop.

1317
01:22:04,620 --> 01:22:05,160
Nice.

1318
01:22:06,640 --> 01:22:07,180
Yeah!

1319
01:22:10,360 --> 01:22:11,760
Let me have a look down here.

1320
01:22:18,520 --> 01:22:25,700
Why am I hearing... Huh?

1321
01:22:27,220 --> 01:22:28,540
Oh!

1322
01:22:30,640 --> 01:22:32,700
Wait, what?

1323
01:22:37,040 --> 01:22:38,200
Oh, interesting.

1324
01:22:39,600 --> 01:22:41,500
We're right next to a cave.

1325
01:22:43,980 --> 01:22:45,060
Look at that.

1326
01:22:45,460 --> 01:22:46,580
Oh, that's fun.

1327
01:22:50,720 --> 01:22:56,880
Um... Uh... Apples...

1328
01:23:03,850 --> 01:23:05,730
This was... I need to find one more of these.

1329
01:23:06,470 --> 01:23:08,090
I gotta retry that experiment.

1330
01:23:09,130 --> 01:23:10,350
Obviously I fucked it up last time.

1331
01:23:10,470 --> 01:23:11,130
I didn't get the achievement.

1332
01:23:13,350 --> 01:23:15,210
That has been such an elusive achievement for me.

1333
01:23:15,290 --> 01:23:19,150
Never got it in the first time I played this game either, like over a year ago.

1334
01:23:21,630 --> 01:23:23,390
I thought I was falling to my death!

1335
01:23:25,770 --> 01:23:27,390
Okay, back on with this.

1336
01:23:28,720 --> 01:23:29,880
Maybe I should repair now.

1337
01:23:30,080 --> 01:23:31,380
Let's just check how this would work.

1338
01:23:31,580 --> 01:23:32,360
So I do that, right?

1339
01:23:33,260 --> 01:23:33,600
Here.

1340
01:23:40,840 --> 01:23:41,260
Wait.

1341
01:23:43,260 --> 01:23:44,320
Did I put it in here?

1342
01:23:47,580 --> 01:23:48,580
Oh, no.

1343
01:23:51,320 --> 01:23:52,680
Where are my membranes at?

1344
01:23:56,240 --> 01:23:57,980
There's no way I forgot that.

1345
01:23:59,140 --> 01:23:59,560
Fuck!

1346
01:24:01,640 --> 01:24:02,640
Fuck you, Oliver!

1347
01:24:04,980 --> 01:24:06,360
Oh, I hate you right now.

1348
01:24:09,100 --> 01:24:11,000
Well, at least we know we can pick up the anvil.

1349
01:24:12,980 --> 01:24:13,400
Fuck!

1350
01:24:16,460 --> 01:24:16,880
No!

1351
01:24:18,680 --> 01:24:22,200
Okay, we gotta keep this on then, and we gotta go get some experience now.

1352
01:24:24,520 --> 01:24:24,940
Um...

1353
01:24:28,220 --> 01:24:29,680
Where did I go from here?

1354
01:24:29,840 --> 01:24:31,020
I guess I just kept going south.

1355
01:24:32,260 --> 01:24:36,280
No, I wouldn't have gone across here because there's no bridge.

1356
01:24:40,140 --> 01:24:44,720
Unless I went around like this... I'll probably just did that.

1357
01:24:55,640 --> 01:24:57,320
Okay, so I found the igloo.

1358
01:25:00,080 --> 01:25:01,500
And... what then?

1359
01:25:03,960 --> 01:25:04,680
Where's my boat?

1360
01:25:04,920 --> 01:25:05,380
Oh, there.

1361
01:25:06,520 --> 01:25:07,760
Not that I need it right here.

1362
01:25:16,440 --> 01:25:18,360
Okay, we made it through the Winter Wonderland.

1363
01:25:23,920 --> 01:25:25,780
Maybe it's time to cook some steaks soon.

1364
01:25:30,100 --> 01:25:31,020
Got a village?

1365
01:25:31,440 --> 01:25:31,840
Oh!

1366
01:25:34,770 --> 01:25:35,970
So I have been here.

1367
01:25:36,870 --> 01:25:38,610
Oh, is this the village?

1368
01:25:39,970 --> 01:25:41,130
It looks like it.

1369
01:25:41,770 --> 01:25:42,770
It is!

1370
01:25:43,590 --> 01:25:44,590
Holy shit!

1371
01:25:45,090 --> 01:25:46,690
It is actually the village.

1372
01:25:48,730 --> 01:25:51,490
Guys, I don't know if you understand how big this is.

1373
01:25:51,610 --> 01:25:54,630
Or if you even understand the implication of this village right here.

1374
01:25:55,690 --> 01:26:02,050
This is the start of a potential retrieval of items lost.

1375
01:26:02,710 --> 01:26:05,890
Because this is where I... Actually, there's also a trial chamber here.

1376
01:26:06,970 --> 01:26:07,890
There's a trial chamber.

1377
01:26:07,990 --> 01:26:08,990
This is where I prepared.

1378
01:26:10,270 --> 01:26:12,610
To go back into the nether to retrieve my items.

1379
01:26:12,790 --> 01:26:14,370
And I did retrieve them, successfully.

1380
01:26:15,350 --> 01:26:18,070
But then I ended up dying in a rather stupid way afterward.

1381
01:26:19,130 --> 01:26:19,890
This was here.

1382
01:26:22,110 --> 01:26:23,570
That's weird, the way I just did that.

1383
01:26:26,820 --> 01:26:28,180
Yeah, I've been here.

1384
01:26:30,000 --> 01:26:33,360
Fucking wreaking havoc on everything.

1385
01:26:33,520 --> 01:26:34,940
Look, this is where I prepared.

1386
01:26:36,380 --> 01:26:37,120
Very nice.

1387
01:26:37,240 --> 01:26:37,860
We can cook now.

1388
01:26:41,380 --> 01:26:44,540
Isn't it kind of funny that we're back in this spot?

1389
01:26:45,500 --> 01:26:46,560
Cooking the same things.

1390
01:26:50,660 --> 01:26:51,800
Oh my goodness!

1391
01:26:54,970 --> 01:26:56,310
30 emeralds?

1392
01:26:56,510 --> 01:26:56,870
Wow!

1393
01:26:57,770 --> 01:26:59,330
Why did I have that here?

1394
01:27:00,890 --> 01:27:02,330
That is incredible!

1395
01:27:03,450 --> 01:27:08,790
Four trials... Yo... Not bad!

1396
01:27:10,210 --> 01:27:12,010
This is already a success.

1397
01:27:12,630 --> 01:27:14,290
Even if nothing else happens.

1398
01:27:18,570 --> 01:27:19,670
Give me this.

1399
01:27:19,890 --> 01:27:20,750
Give me all these, too.

1400
01:27:23,120 --> 01:27:24,100
In there.

1401
01:27:26,660 --> 01:27:27,300
Sure.

1402
01:27:28,840 --> 01:27:29,480
Leather.

1403
01:27:31,840 --> 01:27:32,780
Iron ingot.

1404
01:27:35,560 --> 01:27:36,660
Give me these.

1405
01:27:38,800 --> 01:27:39,840
Breeze rods.

1406
01:27:40,120 --> 01:27:40,640
Bones.

1407
01:27:40,960 --> 01:27:42,000
Bones, actually.

1408
01:27:43,260 --> 01:27:44,860
For dogs, if we find them.

1409
01:27:46,360 --> 01:27:47,460
Yeah, put them in there.

1410
01:27:47,560 --> 01:27:47,900
This is good.

1411
01:27:51,220 --> 01:27:52,120
And gold.

1412
01:27:53,020 --> 01:27:53,500
Okay.

1413
01:27:55,600 --> 01:27:56,620
We're making stakes.

1414
01:27:57,020 --> 01:27:58,320
Oh, life is good!

1415
01:27:59,060 --> 01:28:00,560
Life is real good right now.

1416
01:28:02,340 --> 01:28:02,820
Nice.

1417
01:28:03,040 --> 01:28:04,200
We saved the game.

1418
01:28:04,400 --> 01:28:04,520
Good.

1419
01:28:05,780 --> 01:28:07,040
Actually, the sun is about to go down.

1420
01:28:07,160 --> 01:28:07,580
That's perfect.

1421
01:28:08,280 --> 01:28:11,520
Is that one of my old meats sitting there?

1422
01:28:27,710 --> 01:28:28,030
Okay.

1423
01:28:28,030 --> 01:28:29,270
I'm actually so happy.

1424
01:28:30,330 --> 01:28:31,470
Also, I'm kind of confident.

1425
01:28:31,470 --> 01:28:36,550
If I get into the nether, I'm pretty sure I can find my way again, because I spent so much time trying to find my way last time.

1426
01:28:37,150 --> 01:28:39,090
I think I'm going to recognize things when I see them.

1427
01:28:42,670 --> 01:28:43,650
I don't need any of this.

1428
01:28:43,790 --> 01:28:44,110
This is good.

1429
01:28:45,010 --> 01:28:46,470
I'm just sort of waiting for my food.

1430
01:28:54,840 --> 01:29:02,780
I wonder if I can somehow, right here, make it so that I can always... Oh wait, no, no, no.

1431
01:29:02,800 --> 01:29:03,760
I remember how to get here.

1432
01:29:03,860 --> 01:29:04,580
It's just going south.

1433
01:29:04,780 --> 01:29:05,620
It's just going south.

1434
01:29:06,180 --> 01:29:08,900
I was about to say, maybe I can somehow link a compass to this place.

1435
01:29:09,900 --> 01:29:12,860
So I can always make my way back here in case I need to.

1436
01:29:13,800 --> 01:29:15,960
But it's actually... I just went straight south.

1437
01:29:18,300 --> 01:29:19,420
Good job, passed me.

1438
01:29:20,000 --> 01:29:20,600
Good job.

1439
01:29:21,580 --> 01:29:22,460
Give me those stakes.

1440
01:29:26,200 --> 01:29:27,740
I kind of want to get a bit more beef.

1441
01:29:29,740 --> 01:29:30,400
More cows?

1442
01:29:32,960 --> 01:29:33,760
More cowski?

1443
01:29:38,040 --> 01:29:39,280
This guy has a special bow.

1444
01:29:41,940 --> 01:29:44,460
I will murder him and see what kind of bow that is.

1445
01:29:45,000 --> 01:29:45,220
Oh.

1446
01:29:46,540 --> 01:29:47,740
You also want a piece of me.

1447
01:29:52,870 --> 01:29:53,650
Ouch!

1448
01:29:59,970 --> 01:30:01,310
It didn't give me anything.

1449
01:30:02,090 --> 01:30:03,050
That's fine.

1450
01:30:04,350 --> 01:30:05,430
That's okay.

1451
01:30:12,330 --> 01:30:13,270
Okay, I think I'm ready.

1452
01:30:15,650 --> 01:30:20,730
I should probably store my most valuable things in this chest before I do anything.

1453
01:30:21,410 --> 01:30:23,830
I am tempted to just store this elytra.

1454
01:30:25,170 --> 01:30:28,070
And not bringing in... Yeah, I'm not gonna need it in there.

1455
01:30:28,770 --> 01:30:29,470
Not really.

1456
01:30:33,860 --> 01:30:34,700
Oh!

1457
01:30:36,600 --> 01:30:37,880
Of course!

1458
01:30:38,540 --> 01:30:39,620
I'm an idiot!

1459
01:30:40,060 --> 01:30:41,400
It's right there!

1460
01:30:41,980 --> 01:30:43,300
Are you kidding?

1461
01:30:45,600 --> 01:30:47,020
Oh my god!

1462
01:30:47,440 --> 01:30:48,040
Wonderful!

1463
01:30:49,660 --> 01:30:51,980
I can't believe I actually forgot that.

1464
01:30:53,040 --> 01:30:53,880
Insanity.

1465
01:30:55,540 --> 01:30:56,380
Nice!

1466
01:30:58,140 --> 01:30:59,240
Very good.

1467
01:30:59,660 --> 01:31:00,940
Now it's repaired, at least.

1468
01:31:02,380 --> 01:31:03,580
On with the diamond.

1469
01:31:03,820 --> 01:31:04,900
Oh, that feels great.

1470
01:31:05,260 --> 01:31:06,560
I thought I forgot it.

1471
01:31:07,540 --> 01:31:08,380
Very good.

1472
01:31:13,120 --> 01:31:13,760
Obsidian.

1473
01:31:14,140 --> 01:31:14,940
I have already.

1474
01:31:15,160 --> 01:31:15,320
Good.

1475
01:31:16,320 --> 01:31:16,840
Banners.

1476
01:31:17,540 --> 01:31:18,880
Who needs that?

1477
01:31:19,160 --> 01:31:19,520
Not me.

1478
01:31:20,800 --> 01:31:21,180
Stakes.

1479
01:31:25,160 --> 01:31:25,800
Yeah.

1480
01:31:33,120 --> 01:31:33,940
See ya.

1481
01:31:35,060 --> 01:31:36,340
He's sleeping in my bed now.

1482
01:31:37,580 --> 01:31:38,340
Let me go to bed.

1483
01:31:38,920 --> 01:31:39,480
Yeah.

1484
01:31:40,200 --> 01:31:41,760
Was slain by Vindicator.

1485
01:31:45,580 --> 01:31:46,160
Huh.

1486
01:31:46,720 --> 01:31:48,040
That's what they're called, huh?

1487
01:31:49,040 --> 01:31:50,240
The guys with the axes?

1488
01:31:51,880 --> 01:31:52,460
Vindicator.

1489
01:31:54,120 --> 01:31:54,700
Interesting.

1490
01:31:55,360 --> 01:31:56,620
Ooh, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

1491
01:32:00,920 --> 01:32:01,500
Respawn.

1492
01:32:06,400 --> 01:32:08,260
Oh wait, I forgot how this worked.

1493
01:32:08,820 --> 01:32:12,520
But I would love to do this inside the nether.

1494
01:32:14,580 --> 01:32:15,760
I'm gonna save that for later.

1495
01:32:15,880 --> 01:32:19,000
I don't want to accidentally kill myself with a big explosion or something.

1496
01:32:20,280 --> 01:32:21,260
This is fine for now.

1497
01:32:23,460 --> 01:32:28,380
I'm gonna require some fire resistance potions.

1498
01:32:32,020 --> 01:32:33,120
Sure, put that in there.

1499
01:32:33,320 --> 01:32:33,660
That's fine.

1500
01:32:35,260 --> 01:32:36,960
I'm not gonna need all this right now.

1501
01:32:38,320 --> 01:32:40,060
I will eat the bread first.

1502
01:32:40,320 --> 01:32:43,240
The steak is reserved for high-intent situations.

1503
01:32:48,080 --> 01:32:48,600
Yes.

1504
01:32:51,220 --> 01:32:51,740
Okay.

1505
01:32:53,620 --> 01:32:54,520
Are we ready?

1506
01:32:58,360 --> 01:32:59,460
I think I'm ready.

1507
01:33:02,200 --> 01:33:04,580
Alright, let the exploration begin.

1508
01:33:04,920 --> 01:33:05,600
Oh, bring this.

1509
01:33:10,580 --> 01:33:12,100
Smooth sailing from here on out.

1510
01:33:12,280 --> 01:33:13,240
I promise you.

1511
01:33:19,010 --> 01:33:20,130
Oh, ominous bottles.

1512
01:33:20,490 --> 01:33:21,510
You can put them somewhere.

1513
01:33:23,630 --> 01:33:24,770
Actually, I should have put them in here.

1514
01:33:26,390 --> 01:33:26,930
Silly me.

1515
01:33:28,390 --> 01:33:29,030
There we go.

1516
01:33:30,110 --> 01:33:33,330
I guess the fireworks can go in here as well, since I don't have my Lystra equipped anyway.

1517
01:33:34,190 --> 01:33:34,770
No reason.

1518
01:33:38,090 --> 01:33:39,910
Okay, now I switch my pickaxes.

1519
01:33:40,270 --> 01:33:41,250
Good, and now I go.

1520
01:33:44,630 --> 01:33:45,170
Alright!

1521
01:33:45,990 --> 01:33:46,850
This is it.

1522
01:33:47,330 --> 01:33:48,730
I even have a bed over there.

1523
01:33:48,870 --> 01:33:49,190
Wonderful.

1524
01:33:50,190 --> 01:33:51,170
I'm gonna use that.

1525
01:33:57,550 --> 01:33:58,530
Did you hear that?

1526
01:34:01,910 --> 01:34:03,690
Very creepy scream!

1527
01:34:04,110 --> 01:34:06,530
That just happened right before I went above water.

1528
01:34:06,870 --> 01:34:09,110
And me going above the water cut off that scream.

1529
01:34:11,030 --> 01:34:12,050
Very unsettling.

1530
01:34:30,790 --> 01:34:32,030
Okay, I don't remember this.

1531
01:34:32,210 --> 01:34:33,310
Fuck, I'm already fucked.

1532
01:34:33,550 --> 01:34:34,290
Oh no.

1533
01:34:35,650 --> 01:34:36,890
Oh wait, I do remember that!

1534
01:34:37,350 --> 01:34:38,310
Okay, okay, okay.

1535
01:34:45,810 --> 01:34:47,490
I do remember that on my right side.

1536
01:34:50,750 --> 01:34:52,010
Yeah, I remember this.

1537
01:34:56,150 --> 01:34:57,270
I remember.

1538
01:34:58,930 --> 01:35:01,010
Um... Oh god.

1539
01:35:01,710 --> 01:35:02,150
Whoa!

1540
01:35:02,590 --> 01:35:06,090
Oh man, we're being... Drink this.

1541
01:35:07,230 --> 01:35:08,290
Right now.

1542
01:35:08,750 --> 01:35:10,030
Just to be safe.

1543
01:35:11,250 --> 01:35:12,070
Eat the bread.

1544
01:35:13,110 --> 01:35:15,950
Can you... Where did you go, you cheater?

1545
01:35:17,150 --> 01:35:18,950
He's up and disappeared on me.

1546
01:35:22,430 --> 01:35:22,930
Unreal.

1547
01:35:25,050 --> 01:35:27,390
Just when I was about to retaliate here.

1548
01:35:31,090 --> 01:35:32,550
I think I jumped down here.

1549
01:35:33,470 --> 01:35:36,070
I remember this being on my right.

1550
01:35:41,400 --> 01:35:45,540
So the name of the game now is just find things I recognize and take it from there.

1551
01:35:46,160 --> 01:35:49,600
Because the path itself was quite clear once I'm on it.

1552
01:35:50,260 --> 01:35:53,320
You know, like blocks that are out of place, stuff like that.

1553
01:35:59,200 --> 01:35:59,860
You wanna fight?

1554
01:36:10,240 --> 01:36:11,020
Thank you.

1555
01:36:11,320 --> 01:36:12,480
Give me all that experience.

1556
01:36:20,220 --> 01:36:20,740
Oh.

1557
01:36:23,340 --> 01:36:25,580
I don't know if I ever looted that.

1558
01:36:28,340 --> 01:36:29,620
I must have looted this.

1559
01:36:40,580 --> 01:36:42,040
I am locked in right now.

1560
01:36:54,080 --> 01:36:54,520
Okay.

1561
01:36:57,510 --> 01:36:59,010
I don't think I've looted this.

1562
01:36:59,430 --> 01:37:00,250
Oh, that's new!

1563
01:37:01,850 --> 01:37:02,210
Cool.

1564
01:37:05,230 --> 01:37:06,210
But that's a bad sign.

1565
01:37:06,310 --> 01:37:06,930
It means I haven't been here.

1566
01:37:09,750 --> 01:37:10,930
Maybe not that way, at least.

1567
01:37:12,850 --> 01:37:14,170
I would have taken this for sure.

1568
01:37:24,480 --> 01:37:26,020
I don't remember this at all.

1569
01:37:26,360 --> 01:37:26,820
Oh no.

1570
01:37:29,220 --> 01:37:33,400
I just need to find the start of my path and then it's gonna be smooth sailing.

1571
01:37:33,820 --> 01:37:36,520
The beginning is the hardest because I don't remember where I went from here.

1572
01:37:37,160 --> 01:37:38,140
That's the big issue.

1573
01:37:49,660 --> 01:37:50,760
I found it!

1574
01:37:53,260 --> 01:37:55,320
Yeah, I remember this exact spot here.

1575
01:37:55,460 --> 01:37:56,140
Isn't that funny?

1576
01:37:56,780 --> 01:37:58,020
I guess it's not that weird.

1577
01:37:58,120 --> 01:37:58,960
I've been here multiple times.

1578
01:38:01,780 --> 01:38:02,680
How'd I miss that?

1579
01:38:17,570 --> 01:38:19,410
I'm doing risky jumps here for no reason.

1580
01:38:19,710 --> 01:38:20,230
Why am I doing that?

1581
01:38:22,650 --> 01:38:23,890
Time to be non-risky.

1582
01:38:29,690 --> 01:38:30,130
Aha!

1583
01:38:31,110 --> 01:38:32,530
He's stuck in the terrain!

1584
01:38:37,270 --> 01:38:37,910
See ya.

1585
01:38:42,400 --> 01:38:44,040
So I went up here.

1586
01:38:45,380 --> 01:38:46,740
Where did I go from here?

1587
01:38:48,620 --> 01:38:49,880
Let's try this way first.

1588
01:38:57,280 --> 01:38:57,820
No.

1589
01:38:58,680 --> 01:39:00,320
But I do remember this view.

1590
01:39:10,310 --> 01:39:11,070
Maybe down here?

1591
01:39:13,130 --> 01:39:14,310
So I came from up there.

1592
01:39:14,730 --> 01:39:15,830
Maybe I went this way.

1593
01:39:17,850 --> 01:39:19,010
Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh!

1594
01:39:22,490 --> 01:39:23,250
Looks familiar?

1595
01:39:24,930 --> 01:39:26,430
No, I would have made the bridge here.

1596
01:39:26,490 --> 01:39:27,630
There's no way I would have made that jump.

1597
01:39:29,650 --> 01:39:32,790
Unless... I jumped down here and went up.

1598
01:39:38,380 --> 01:39:39,440
I'm not convinced.

1599
01:39:39,860 --> 01:39:42,820
I have to make absolutely sure I'm on the right path first.

1600
01:39:43,960 --> 01:39:44,540
Yes!

1601
01:39:44,700 --> 01:39:45,480
We're getting music!

1602
01:39:49,500 --> 01:39:50,360
More gold?

1603
01:39:50,480 --> 01:39:50,660
Sure.

1604
01:39:54,820 --> 01:39:56,340
I don't remember this.

1605
01:39:58,360 --> 01:39:59,080
Damn.

1606
01:40:01,760 --> 01:40:07,700
Man, these fortresses here are truly labyrinths, you know?

1607
01:40:08,200 --> 01:40:11,040
Every corridor looks the same, pretty much.

1608
01:40:21,040 --> 01:40:21,360
Ooh!

1609
01:40:22,680 --> 01:40:23,600
That's gotta be me.

1610
01:40:24,420 --> 01:40:25,440
In fact, I remember this.

1611
01:40:26,260 --> 01:40:26,760
I think.

1612
01:40:29,140 --> 01:40:30,100
Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

1613
01:40:30,260 --> 01:40:30,800
Did I make a tunnel?

1614
01:40:33,800 --> 01:40:34,820
Yes, I did!

1615
01:40:35,600 --> 01:40:36,460
This has to be it.

1616
01:40:37,440 --> 01:40:38,580
Okay, hold on, hold on, hold on, hold on.

1617
01:40:39,280 --> 01:40:43,900
I need to, I need to fucking... If I ever make this trip again, I need to make sure I don't forget.

1618
01:40:46,040 --> 01:40:47,040
Arrow pointing that way.

1619
01:40:51,140 --> 01:40:52,620
We have to mark everything now.

1620
01:40:56,970 --> 01:40:58,090
We have to mark.

1621
01:40:59,350 --> 01:41:00,770
What happens if you don't mark?

1622
01:41:01,450 --> 01:41:02,430
Bad things.

1623
01:41:02,890 --> 01:41:03,450
You know?

1624
01:41:04,070 --> 01:41:05,310
Things I've experienced.

1625
01:41:06,330 --> 01:41:08,330
Things I would rather not experience again.

1626
01:41:09,570 --> 01:41:15,510
But now that I'm marking... It's like... For every mark I put... The more sane I become.

1627
01:41:16,590 --> 01:41:17,730
