02:44:24,540 --> 02:44:25,920
We need to mend everything.

2445
02:44:27,420 --> 02:44:28,540
Everything gets mended.

2446
02:44:37,680 --> 02:44:39,860
So let's just have a look over here, shall we?

2447
02:44:43,840 --> 02:44:45,400
First, I'm gonna get on top of this mountain.

2448
02:44:48,960 --> 02:44:49,620
Get up here.

2449
02:44:55,560 --> 02:44:56,800
Okay, there's a village right there.

2450
02:44:58,780 --> 02:44:59,540
I'm gonna go there.

2451
02:45:00,080 --> 02:45:02,840
We're gonna take a nap, such that if we die, we spawn right here.

2452
02:45:09,340 --> 02:45:10,660
That is a good idea.

2453
02:45:12,580 --> 02:45:14,020
Because I want to bring this bed with me.

2454
02:45:22,900 --> 02:45:24,180
Oh, we got a cat as well.

2455
02:45:28,460 --> 02:45:29,560
Do I have any fish?

2456
02:45:30,200 --> 02:45:30,980
I don't.

2457
02:45:32,000 --> 02:45:32,920
Only cooked once.

2458
02:45:37,870 --> 02:45:40,110
Then again, do I really want to bring that cat all the way back?

2459
02:45:40,230 --> 02:45:42,270
That's going to be hell to do.

2460
02:45:51,990 --> 02:45:52,890
There we go.

2461
02:45:53,270 --> 02:45:54,250
Respawn point set.

2462
02:45:54,450 --> 02:45:54,770
Nice.

2463
02:45:57,050 --> 02:45:57,690
Okay.

2464
02:46:00,430 --> 02:46:02,070
We've got snow over there.

2465
02:46:02,230 --> 02:46:02,990
Mushroom there.

2466
02:46:05,830 --> 02:46:07,150
Jungle over there.

2467
02:46:08,310 --> 02:46:09,310
Pink there.

2468
02:46:12,490 --> 02:46:14,150
So much happening in this area.

2469
02:46:21,090 --> 02:46:22,250
Which way is home?

2470
02:46:23,470 --> 02:46:24,230
That way.

2471
02:46:27,070 --> 02:46:28,470
That way, precisely.

2472
02:46:33,450 --> 02:46:35,010
It's time for Elytra.

2473
02:46:40,550 --> 02:46:42,370
My inventory is shit.

2474
02:46:55,330 --> 02:46:56,010
Okay.

2475
02:46:56,010 --> 02:47:01,350
Let's take a look... at what we got.

2476
02:47:09,990 --> 02:47:14,570
This is gonna be the most chill... journey home.

2477
02:47:15,610 --> 02:47:19,850
We're gonna cruise... all the way.

2478
02:47:25,010 --> 02:47:25,770
Oh, yeah.

2479
02:47:26,210 --> 02:47:28,010
Maybe we'll find something cool on the way as well.

2480
02:47:35,940 --> 02:47:37,440
That shield is blocking my view, though.

2481
02:47:37,540 --> 02:47:38,500
It's kind of annoying me right now.

2482
02:47:40,960 --> 02:47:43,520
It's a little less safe, but, you know, I think it's worth it.

2483
02:47:44,520 --> 02:47:45,260
Just for the view.

2484
02:47:45,380 --> 02:47:46,480
We got a little portal over there.

2485
02:47:52,160 --> 02:47:53,440
I would like to check that out.

2486
02:47:53,680 --> 02:47:54,940
At least just loot the box.

2487
02:48:04,940 --> 02:48:07,760
Look at me cruising in like this for a landing.

2488
02:48:09,360 --> 02:48:10,460
Smooth as butter.

2489
02:48:11,700 --> 02:48:12,660
And a clock!

2490
02:48:15,280 --> 02:48:17,400
And a hole with efficiency on it.

2491
02:48:18,920 --> 02:48:20,340
Don't really want that, I don't think.

2492
02:48:34,020 --> 02:48:34,420
Nice!

2493
02:48:38,160 --> 02:48:39,580
Also, I saw something over here.

2494
02:48:48,780 --> 02:48:50,120
Something that looked a little interesting.

2495
02:48:57,420 --> 02:48:58,460
Oh yeah, look at that.

2496
02:48:59,340 --> 02:48:59,820
Swamp.

2497
02:49:02,780 --> 02:49:04,040
Nasty, murky water.

2498
02:49:09,020 --> 02:49:10,060
What do we have here?

2499
02:49:18,580 --> 02:49:21,860
Oh man, it feels so liberating having these items back.

2500
02:49:22,020 --> 02:49:22,840
I can't even tell you.

2501
02:49:23,200 --> 02:49:30,080
It's like a massive weight is off my shoulders that has been pressing down all this time, knowing that these items were out here.

2502
02:49:31,500 --> 02:49:32,680
That looks kind of fun.

2503
02:49:34,100 --> 02:49:36,860
Nasty poop water, but a waterfall of it.

2504
02:49:38,960 --> 02:49:42,780
I'm gonna need this compass in my inventory like this, please.

2505
02:49:45,060 --> 02:49:45,800
Maybe there.

2506
02:49:51,080 --> 02:49:51,940
That way home.

2507
02:49:56,900 --> 02:49:57,740
Another portal.

2508
02:49:59,080 --> 02:50:01,420
So weird, you get to see so much from up here.

2509
02:50:05,580 --> 02:50:07,900
By the way, fire aspect on my sword.

2510
02:50:12,400 --> 02:50:13,420
We're so back.

2511
02:50:37,120 --> 02:50:42,540
Whoa... This is gonna be a long journey, I think, because I went a long distance in the nether.

2512
02:50:44,160 --> 02:50:45,680
A very long distance.

2513
02:50:58,580 --> 02:50:59,760
Up we go!

2514
02:51:00,800 --> 02:51:01,900
Get some height.

2515
02:51:02,940 --> 02:51:04,240
Look at this!

2516
02:51:05,660 --> 02:51:06,700
Massive ocean.

2517
02:51:08,180 --> 02:51:10,200
Durability almost half.

2518
02:51:13,180 --> 02:51:14,780
In fact, it's sort of this way.

2519
02:51:24,660 --> 02:51:25,380
Damn.

2520
02:51:25,820 --> 02:51:26,940
So much water here.

2521
02:51:30,390 --> 02:51:31,810
This is a proper ocean.

2522
02:51:37,570 --> 02:51:39,810
The game can't even load fast enough.

2523
02:51:40,210 --> 02:51:41,050
Look at this.

2524
02:51:41,350 --> 02:51:42,610
I'm way too fast.

2525
02:51:46,590 --> 02:51:49,050
I am totally overpowered right now.

2526
02:51:51,910 --> 02:51:54,290
Also, I got to keep an eye on the amount of rockets I have.

2527
02:51:55,330 --> 02:51:56,470
Imagine falling down.

2528
02:52:00,200 --> 02:52:01,440
In the wrong place.

2529
02:52:11,180 --> 02:52:11,700
Okay.

2530
02:52:14,320 --> 02:52:15,760
Interesting little area here.

2531
02:52:20,340 --> 02:52:21,820
Man, this is so much water.

2532
02:52:22,060 --> 02:52:22,740
Holy shit.

2533
02:52:23,220 --> 02:52:24,700
This is truly the ocean.

2534
02:52:24,860 --> 02:52:25,560
Oh, look at that one.

2535
02:52:28,910 --> 02:52:30,870
It's an island with mushrooms.

2536
02:52:45,510 --> 02:52:46,790
Let's park it right here.

2537
02:52:58,980 --> 02:53:01,000
Was there anything special about this place?

2538
02:53:03,320 --> 02:53:04,620
Right, the weird cows.

2539
02:53:06,980 --> 02:53:08,540
They don't drop anything special, do they?

2540
02:53:11,820 --> 02:53:14,900
I mean, it's plenty of food for me, look at this!

2541
02:53:16,560 --> 02:53:18,100
Fire aspect, here I come!

2542
02:53:21,340 --> 02:53:22,140
Everyone dies!

2543
02:53:24,180 --> 02:53:26,860
I have come to your island, and I demand your meat.

2544
02:53:39,220 --> 02:53:39,660
Damn.

2545
02:53:39,660 --> 02:53:42,260
I could also set up camp here and become their king.

2546
02:53:44,400 --> 02:53:45,620
Rule over these lands.

2547
02:53:50,940 --> 02:53:59,920
I wonder if I were to plant some of these mushrooms at home, if these cows would eventually, or my cows at home, would be infected with mushrooms, like they are here.

2548
02:54:04,820 --> 02:54:06,180
Getting so much steak.

2549
02:54:06,380 --> 02:54:06,660
Damn.

2550
02:54:11,480 --> 02:54:13,080
You got a nice sunset here?

2551
02:54:14,360 --> 02:54:15,300
You know what?

2552
02:54:15,960 --> 02:54:16,900
Perfect time.

2553
02:54:17,780 --> 02:54:22,100
To celebrate the success of our retrieval of items.

2554
02:54:25,560 --> 02:54:26,460
Right there.

2555
02:54:39,860 --> 02:54:41,620
Let me cook some chops here.

2556
02:54:42,880 --> 02:54:44,140
And some rabbit.

2557
02:54:46,480 --> 02:54:47,620
Look at that.

2558
02:54:51,620 --> 02:54:53,060
Ah, cheers everybody!

2559
02:55:09,460 --> 02:55:10,780
Nice, there they come.

2560
02:55:11,900 --> 02:55:12,800
Food is done.

2561
02:55:16,940 --> 02:55:18,220
We have more food.

2562
02:55:20,800 --> 02:55:21,360
Nope.

2563
02:55:37,900 --> 02:55:38,940
I'm so sorry.

2564
02:55:39,880 --> 02:55:41,500
It does actually feel kind of bad.

2565
02:55:41,960 --> 02:55:43,140
I come here, you know.

2566
02:55:43,800 --> 02:55:45,780
They're just chilling, hanging out on this island.

2567
02:55:46,840 --> 02:55:48,580
I arrived and fucked shit up.

2568
02:55:54,100 --> 02:55:55,360
Fucking everyone is dead.

2569
02:56:02,230 --> 02:56:03,170
I killed everyone.

2570
02:56:03,470 --> 02:56:04,490
Oh, there's some left.

2571
02:56:04,670 --> 02:56:04,850
Okay.

2572
02:56:05,610 --> 02:56:06,910
Maybe I should leave some alive.

2573
02:56:07,310 --> 02:56:09,630
Maybe they can make baby mushroom cows.

2574
02:56:12,770 --> 02:56:14,230
I'm gonna leave two alive.

2575
02:56:18,490 --> 02:56:20,070
So they can repopulate this.

2576
02:56:20,210 --> 02:56:20,970
Ah, yo, babies!

2577
02:56:21,750 --> 02:56:22,810
Baby mushroom cow!

2578
02:56:23,970 --> 02:56:25,710
So they do make babies here too.

2579
02:56:25,870 --> 02:56:26,390
Okay, perfect.

2580
02:56:31,280 --> 02:56:33,160
By the way, there's no, like, skeletons or anything here.

2581
02:56:36,740 --> 02:56:38,100
There's no enemies at all.

2582
02:56:41,700 --> 02:56:42,060
Weird.

2583
02:56:44,960 --> 02:56:45,940
It's like a sanctuary.

2584
02:56:47,820 --> 02:56:49,420
Wait, do these cows keep spawning?

2585
02:56:49,520 --> 02:56:49,820
What's happening?

2586
02:56:49,920 --> 02:56:50,360
Why are there so many?

2587
02:56:55,160 --> 02:56:56,860
Oh my god, I have over 64 sticks.

2588
02:57:02,000 --> 02:57:02,780
Deposit them.

2589
02:57:06,680 --> 02:57:07,880
I'm not done killing.

2590
02:57:10,160 --> 02:57:11,660
I'm not done killing.

2591
02:57:17,740 --> 02:57:18,840
Come here.

2592
02:57:20,580 --> 02:57:21,160
You.

2593
02:57:23,740 --> 02:57:24,940
Shit, did I kill everyone?

2594
02:57:25,460 --> 02:57:26,500
I had one job.

2595
02:57:32,340 --> 02:57:32,860
Oh, no.

2596
02:57:33,540 --> 02:57:34,380
Oh, wait, wait, wait.

2597
02:57:35,660 --> 02:57:36,360
We optimized.

2598
02:57:36,880 --> 02:57:38,120
We got two baby cows.

2599
02:57:38,240 --> 02:57:39,600
They're going to grow up and mate together.

2600
02:57:40,580 --> 02:57:41,260
Incest, I guess.

2601
02:57:41,400 --> 02:57:42,380
But, you know, it is what it is.

2602
02:57:43,200 --> 02:57:47,100
Well, I guess this entire island is mega incest.

2603
02:57:48,360 --> 02:57:50,880
There's, like, no diversity here in the genes.

2604
02:57:51,680 --> 02:57:52,400
At all.

2605
02:57:54,800 --> 02:57:56,180
Ah, wait, we got multiple survivors.

2606
02:57:57,000 --> 02:57:57,520
Kill them.

2607
02:57:59,080 --> 02:58:00,000
We got the babies.

2608
02:58:02,030 --> 02:58:03,570
I can safely kill these now.

2609
02:58:04,850 --> 02:58:06,210
And still feel good about it.

2610
02:58:09,010 --> 02:58:10,790
Maybe I'll be back to this place in the future.

2611
02:58:11,010 --> 02:58:13,390
To see how the population has been grown.

2612
02:58:13,930 --> 02:58:15,070
Or steadily growing.

2613
02:58:17,430 --> 02:58:20,170
Man, it is kind of interesting that there's no enemies here.

2614
02:58:20,750 --> 02:58:22,490
Like, it's night and nothing is spawning.

2615
02:58:23,970 --> 02:58:24,430
Look!

2616
02:58:25,390 --> 02:58:26,910
Not even on the other side of the island.

2617
02:58:27,350 --> 02:58:28,670
It's middle of the night.

2618
02:58:34,960 --> 02:58:35,940
Isn't that intriguing?

2619
02:58:41,760 --> 02:58:42,960
I'm gonna leave this here.

2620
02:58:44,080 --> 02:58:44,560
Yeah.

2621
02:58:45,920 --> 02:58:47,140
Did you just spawn?

2622
02:58:49,140 --> 02:58:49,620
Hello.

2623
02:58:54,980 --> 02:58:55,840
Which way is home?

2624
02:58:56,000 --> 02:58:56,440
That way.

2625
02:58:57,440 --> 02:58:58,280
Alright, I'm flying.

2626
02:58:58,460 --> 02:58:59,160
Actually, I'm gonna sleep.

2627
02:59:04,160 --> 02:59:04,800
There we go.

2628
02:59:13,820 --> 02:59:14,480
Off we go.

2629
02:59:20,020 --> 02:59:22,180
What a nice little murder spree we were on there.

2630
02:59:36,710 --> 02:59:37,230
Portal?

2631
02:59:37,230 --> 02:59:38,930
I wonder how close I am to home.

2632
02:59:40,030 --> 02:59:41,570
I think I'm very far away.

2633
02:59:41,690 --> 02:59:42,790
Yo, that looks hella cool.

2634
02:59:45,730 --> 02:59:46,250
What?

2635
02:59:49,110 --> 02:59:49,930
Hold on.

2636
02:59:51,150 --> 02:59:52,070
Floating islands!

2637
02:59:52,410 --> 02:59:54,190
Uh-oh, the ultimate crime!

2638
02:59:56,230 --> 02:59:58,170
I'm not happy about this at all.

2639
02:59:58,410 --> 02:59:59,410
This is my nightmare.

2640
03:00:10,410 --> 03:00:11,690
No fear, no fear!

2641
03:00:12,730 --> 03:00:28,070
Oh my, we've got snow now.

2642
03:00:39,290 --> 03:00:41,630
I wonder if I will recognize some of this at some point.

2643
03:00:44,530 --> 03:00:44,890
Tower?

2644
03:01:00,880 --> 03:01:01,980
This way, actually.

2645
03:01:03,920 --> 03:01:05,040
Went to Wonderland?

2646
03:01:06,660 --> 03:01:07,920
Have I been to that tower?

2647
03:01:10,020 --> 03:01:10,960
I'm not sure.

2648
03:01:20,060 --> 03:01:21,400
Beautiful landing.

2649
03:01:24,020 --> 03:01:25,440
Incredible performance.

2650
03:01:26,600 --> 03:01:27,440
Sing!

2651
03:01:40,720 --> 03:01:41,560
Hello!

2652
03:01:42,060 --> 03:01:43,820
Oh, I have my psycho bow now.

2653
03:01:47,560 --> 03:01:48,520
Infinite arrows!

2654
03:01:50,360 --> 03:01:51,220
Infinite fun.

2655
03:01:54,660 --> 03:01:56,120
Look at these fools!

2656
03:01:58,240 --> 03:01:59,200
Dude, I have an idea.

2657
03:02:06,800 --> 03:02:07,760
This works, right?

2658
03:02:08,000 --> 03:02:08,740
It's gonna free-fall.

2659
03:02:16,300 --> 03:02:16,820
Huh?

2660
03:02:16,820 --> 03:02:17,560
Oh shit!

2661
03:02:22,140 --> 03:02:23,720
They figured out how to use the stairs!

2662
03:02:27,850 --> 03:02:29,630
Dude, this sword is kicking ass!

2663
03:02:30,230 --> 03:02:31,270
Oh, wow.

2664
03:02:31,810 --> 03:02:32,530
Everyone dies.

2665
03:02:37,090 --> 03:02:39,050
Oh, actually, we're kind of low on durability there.

2666
03:02:39,330 --> 03:02:39,770
Gotta be careful.

2667
03:02:42,550 --> 03:02:43,850
Man, my inventory is full!

2668
03:02:44,010 --> 03:02:44,550
It's way too full.

2669
03:02:45,190 --> 03:02:45,910
We gotta fix this.

2670
03:02:51,790 --> 03:02:54,850
Let's put in... No, I need this.

2671
03:03:01,290 --> 03:03:02,150
Put them in there.

2672
03:03:11,090 --> 03:03:11,370
Okay.

2673
03:03:16,270 --> 03:03:16,550
There.

2674
03:03:21,010 --> 03:03:21,670
Boat is good.

2675
03:03:22,010 --> 03:03:23,790
Oh, we also have a full... Oh, nice, nice, nice.

2676
03:03:24,970 --> 03:03:25,930
Ah, we need this, actually.

2677
03:03:27,130 --> 03:03:27,990
Okay, okay, okay, okay, okay.

2678
03:03:32,040 --> 03:03:40,140
So, touch... Yeah.

2679
03:03:48,060 --> 03:03:49,240
Alright then, fools.

2680
03:03:52,940 --> 03:03:53,960
Get punched!

2681
03:04:16,990 --> 03:04:18,690
Bro, I'm not taking any damage!

2682
03:04:19,710 --> 03:04:21,010
This armor is too good!

2683
03:04:30,410 --> 03:04:30,890
Punch!

2684
03:04:35,810 --> 03:04:36,290
Wait.

2685
03:04:37,290 --> 03:04:38,130
Have I been here?

2686
03:04:38,430 --> 03:04:41,050
Why is there a crafting table?

2687
03:04:42,670 --> 03:04:43,870
Unless they put that here.

2688
03:04:49,780 --> 03:04:50,940
Maybe they just put that there.

2689
03:04:53,560 --> 03:04:54,000
Defeat it!

2690
03:04:58,240 --> 03:04:59,340
God, this is so much fun.

2691
03:05:01,000 --> 03:05:02,920
Now we gotta go this way.

2692
03:05:05,220 --> 03:05:06,160
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

2693
03:05:06,200 --> 03:05:06,740
We gotta repair.

2694
03:05:09,460 --> 03:05:11,820
Tell me we still have that anvil.

2695
03:05:17,620 --> 03:05:18,760
Where is it?

2696
03:05:20,340 --> 03:05:20,900
Shit.

2697
03:05:23,380 --> 03:05:24,240
Eh.

2698
03:05:24,700 --> 03:05:25,740
It'll be fine.

2699
03:05:28,240 --> 03:05:32,180
I just need to wear this... ...when I get experience.

2700
03:05:34,780 --> 03:05:36,040
Stop that!

2701
03:05:36,580 --> 03:05:37,400
There we go.

2702
03:05:43,440 --> 03:05:44,700
And we're off.

2703
03:05:47,920 --> 03:05:52,040
In fact, with all this snow here, let's look for an igloo.

2704
03:05:55,180 --> 03:05:58,720
I am looking, looking, scanning, scanning.

2705
03:06:04,520 --> 03:06:06,620
Not sure I see anything.

2706
03:06:07,960 --> 03:06:10,500
If anything, we would need to go high up somewhere.

2707
03:06:14,760 --> 03:06:15,700
Let's go up here.

2708
03:06:26,900 --> 03:06:30,500
I do love being in the middle of nowhere, and we seem to be very far from home still.

2709
03:06:33,140 --> 03:06:34,680
So much potential for discovery.

2710
03:06:39,360 --> 03:06:41,080
Also always have the food equipped, of course.

2711
03:07:16,600 --> 03:07:18,220
Hmm, not seeing anything.

2712
03:07:25,960 --> 03:07:28,900
Maybe it can only be on very flat areas.

2713
03:07:31,500 --> 03:07:32,880
And this is kind of hilly.

2714
03:07:40,410 --> 03:07:40,730
What?

2715
03:07:41,090 --> 03:07:41,430
Oh!

2716
03:07:43,510 --> 03:07:44,110
Sorry.

2717
03:07:44,970 --> 03:07:46,230
I need to kill you.

2718
03:07:47,830 --> 03:07:48,950
You dropped fish!

2719
03:07:51,270 --> 03:07:51,870
Nice!

2720
03:07:53,610 --> 03:07:55,330
Taken right out of your tummy, huh?

2721
03:07:55,530 --> 03:07:56,810
I cut it out with a knife.

2722
03:08:03,790 --> 03:08:06,470
This is a crazy big winter wonderland.

2723
03:08:14,900 --> 03:08:15,900
Touch the clouds.

2724
03:08:17,200 --> 03:08:18,560
Mmm, delicious.

2725
03:08:23,520 --> 03:08:25,300
We're leaving Winter Wonderland.

2726
03:08:29,580 --> 03:08:30,640
That's a funny tree.

2727
03:08:40,100 --> 03:08:41,880
Come on, show me something.

2728
03:08:55,040 --> 03:08:56,660
This is relatively flat.

2729
03:09:01,420 --> 03:09:02,060
Glide!

2730
03:09:04,900 --> 03:09:06,060
Little Tibby Tap.

2731
03:09:09,240 --> 03:09:12,020
I think I'm actually faster with the boat on ice.

2732
03:09:17,780 --> 03:09:19,120
Which is kind of nuts.

2733
03:09:34,880 --> 03:09:37,120
Too many trees, I can't see anything.

2734
03:09:38,340 --> 03:09:38,900
Damn.

2735
03:09:45,920 --> 03:09:47,520
Got a little village over there.

2736
03:09:53,120 --> 03:09:53,960
It's bedtime.

2737
03:10:13,360 --> 03:10:14,540
I'm looking for an igloo.

2738
03:10:26,620 --> 03:10:28,420
Of course, it's hard to see anything down here.

2739
03:10:30,320 --> 03:10:31,180
Here's what it is.

2740
03:10:37,710 --> 03:10:39,110
Not seeing anything here.

2741
03:10:40,330 --> 03:10:41,490
And I'm still going home.

2742
03:10:42,150 --> 03:10:43,450
Whoa, careful, that looks like a drop.

2743
03:10:45,970 --> 03:10:46,790
And it was.

2744
03:10:48,770 --> 03:10:50,730
And again, on a boat, I shouldn't be scared of that.

2745
03:10:52,670 --> 03:10:54,390
Except it could drop me down into lava.

2746
03:10:54,910 --> 03:10:56,810
And that would be terrible.

2747
03:11:18,740 --> 03:11:19,140
Fly.

2748
03:11:19,140 --> 03:11:21,140
Make a nice landing on the edge here.

2749
03:11:21,260 --> 03:11:23,340
No, actually, I'm too scared of flying directly into things.

2750
03:11:26,800 --> 03:11:27,540
There we go.

2751
03:11:27,740 --> 03:11:27,940
Beautiful.

2752
03:11:33,830 --> 03:11:35,170
I'm gonna get up here and have a look around.

2753
03:11:50,710 --> 03:11:51,470
Maybe that one.

2754
03:11:51,710 --> 03:11:53,310
I don't know if that works.

2755
03:11:54,070 --> 03:11:55,890
If it's inside a village like that.

2756
03:12:17,520 --> 03:12:18,180
Something there.

2757
03:12:23,320 --> 03:12:24,400
I'm gonna check out that one.

2758
03:12:25,020 --> 03:12:26,400
I don't know if that qualifies.

2759
03:12:27,280 --> 03:12:28,400
I don't think it does.

2760
03:12:28,900 --> 03:12:30,580
But, uh, let's just check anyway.

2761
03:12:33,880 --> 03:12:34,760
Oh, kitty cat!

2762
03:12:35,660 --> 03:12:38,140
I got a cod found in the stomach of a bear.

2763
03:12:45,950 --> 03:12:47,050
Doesn't look promising.

2764
03:12:47,350 --> 03:12:49,430
In fact, I'm just gonna put my save point here.

2765
03:12:51,290 --> 03:12:52,170
Just in case.

2766
03:12:52,350 --> 03:12:53,430
Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh.

2767
03:12:55,610 --> 03:12:56,430
Maybe that one.

2768
03:13:06,390 --> 03:13:08,950
Bro, this shovel is off the chain.

2769
03:13:09,950 --> 03:13:11,330
It's literally a shovel.

2770
03:13:17,250 --> 03:13:18,130
It's sick!

2771
03:13:25,910 --> 03:13:27,190
Give me your wares.

2772
03:13:30,890 --> 03:13:32,290
Where's your local tradesman?

2773
03:13:35,370 --> 03:13:36,850
Are you the local tradesman?

2774
03:13:38,470 --> 03:13:39,330
You're nothing.

2775
03:13:40,130 --> 03:13:41,070
You're nothing!

2776
03:13:44,200 --> 03:13:46,440
Maybe they have an anvil.

2777
03:13:47,820 --> 03:13:50,940
In fact, maybe I have one inside of this.

2778
03:14:00,280 --> 03:14:00,760
No.

2779
03:14:01,400 --> 03:14:02,740
Nothing inside there.

2780
03:14:04,120 --> 03:14:05,120
Now we know that.

2781
03:14:08,140 --> 03:14:10,440
I'm pretty sure I put my anvil in one of these pouches.

2782
03:14:17,690 --> 03:14:18,710
That's an empty pouch, right?

2783
03:14:18,810 --> 03:14:19,730
What am I doing?

2784
03:14:23,130 --> 03:14:25,350
Well, I can't... I don't have anything to put in there right now.

2785
03:14:26,710 --> 03:14:27,230
Damn it!

2786
03:14:30,150 --> 03:14:31,070
It's not here either.

2787
03:14:40,600 --> 03:14:41,800
I must have one.

2788
03:14:42,660 --> 03:14:43,300
Somewhere.

2789
03:14:44,860 --> 03:14:48,560
In fact, I don't think I've ever seen an anvil in a village.

2790
03:14:50,000 --> 03:14:51,460
Unless I'm imagining things.

2791
03:14:55,640 --> 03:14:57,560
They make dyed pants.

2792
03:15:00,180 --> 03:15:01,480
Splashing around in there.

2793
03:15:05,940 --> 03:15:07,300
Oh yeah, monies!

2794
03:15:08,020 --> 03:15:08,660
Thanks.

2795
03:15:12,110 --> 03:15:13,550
Thank you for all your hard work.

2796
03:15:13,930 --> 03:15:16,850
I am reaping the benefits of your hard work right now.

2797
03:15:17,930 --> 03:15:18,990
It feels good.

2798
03:15:19,470 --> 03:15:20,610
It feels real good.

2799
03:15:28,470 --> 03:15:29,870
That looked interesting to me.

2800
03:15:33,110 --> 03:15:35,830
Nope, nothing noteworthy there.

2801
03:15:44,260 --> 03:15:46,580
I'm trying to see if I can see an igloo through the forest.

2802
03:15:50,980 --> 03:15:51,460
No.

2803
03:15:56,760 --> 03:15:58,260
We're leaving the snowy area.

2804
03:15:59,340 --> 03:16:00,460
Let me take another look.

2805
03:16:21,960 --> 03:16:22,840
Okay, park here.

2806
03:16:24,340 --> 03:16:26,740
And I think it's time we take this off now, because it's too risky.

2807
03:16:31,460 --> 03:16:32,240
What do we have?

2808
03:16:33,140 --> 03:16:37,040
Wait, is that... Is that where I just was?

2809
03:16:37,280 --> 03:16:37,820
No way, right?

2810
03:16:38,700 --> 03:16:39,680
That was over there somewhere.

2811
03:16:49,100 --> 03:16:50,120
Anyway, time to die.

2812
03:17:09,610 --> 03:17:11,430
Man, infinite arrows is insane.

2813
03:17:13,390 --> 03:17:15,810
I don't have to worry about ammo at all!

2814
03:17:18,750 --> 03:17:20,790
Yo, you... they imprisoned you.

2815
03:17:21,150 --> 03:17:22,170
We can't have that.

2816
03:17:23,230 --> 03:17:24,190
Get out there.

2817
03:17:24,930 --> 03:17:26,110
And have some fun.

2818
03:17:27,290 --> 03:17:28,030
Let's go!

2819
03:17:28,610 --> 03:17:29,550
Come on, big guy.

2820
03:17:38,410 --> 03:17:39,770
Get him, get him!

2821
03:17:39,990 --> 03:17:40,690
Nice!

2822
03:17:41,110 --> 03:17:41,610
Teamwork.

2823
03:17:42,850 --> 03:17:44,290
You're also free.

2824
03:17:46,030 --> 03:17:47,430
Weird creatures.

2825
03:17:48,710 --> 03:17:49,890
So odd.

2826
03:17:50,370 --> 03:17:51,290
Those creatures.

2827
03:17:56,770 --> 03:17:57,630
I need steak.

2828
03:18:00,150 --> 03:18:01,530
This is like the way to get food.

2829
03:18:01,710 --> 03:18:05,730
You gotta find the mushroom islands and just slaughter everyone.

2830
03:18:07,930 --> 03:18:09,030
I don't want any of this.

2831
03:18:10,870 --> 03:18:12,150
Okay, what am I seeing here?

2832
03:18:22,890 --> 03:18:23,330
Village!

2833
03:18:26,310 --> 03:18:27,210
Another village.

2834
03:18:35,290 --> 03:18:35,890
Hmm.

2835
03:18:38,030 --> 03:18:39,110
Oh, I can't fly.

2836
03:18:39,270 --> 03:18:40,430
Don't try to fly.

2837
03:18:42,590 --> 03:18:44,450
You're not flying anymore right now.

2838
03:18:45,010 --> 03:18:45,550
Stop it.

2839
03:18:55,260 --> 03:18:56,160
I'm gonna go over here.

2840
03:19:05,040 --> 03:19:05,720
Don't eat that.

2841
03:19:07,780 --> 03:19:08,600
You're also free?

2842
03:19:18,530 --> 03:19:19,430
Is that one?

2843
03:19:21,290 --> 03:19:22,310
Hey, maybe.

2844
03:19:25,950 --> 03:19:28,530
I see the torch.

2845
03:19:34,150 --> 03:19:35,710
Motherfuckers can't hide from me.

2846
03:19:36,230 --> 03:19:37,490
I see everything.

2847
03:19:39,170 --> 03:19:40,450
Goddamn, I'm a god.

2848
03:19:43,360 --> 03:19:45,440
Look, it's the exact same setup.

2849
03:19:49,400 --> 03:19:50,960
Golden apple and everything.

2850
03:19:54,560 --> 03:19:56,080
Splash potion of weakness.

2851
03:19:58,160 --> 03:19:58,840
Wait.

2852
03:20:01,020 --> 03:20:02,780
Hold on, I gotta read this achievement again.

2853
03:20:03,660 --> 03:20:04,040
Adventure?

2854
03:20:06,800 --> 03:20:09,240
It was the... what was it?

2855
03:20:12,620 --> 03:20:13,180
Minecraft?

2856
03:20:13,660 --> 03:20:14,200
There.

2857
03:20:14,660 --> 03:20:17,620
Weaken and then cure a zombie villager.

2858
03:20:24,720 --> 03:20:25,700
Okay, wait, wait, wait.

2859
03:20:25,840 --> 03:20:28,400
So this arrow says he can become a zombie.

2860
03:20:29,800 --> 03:20:33,420
Obviously this means I can cure him and make him into a normal villager.

2861
03:20:35,940 --> 03:20:37,540
But I have to weaken first.

2862
03:20:50,170 --> 03:20:52,270
Okay, he's weakened.

2863
03:20:52,750 --> 03:20:53,790
Now.

2864
03:21:08,350 --> 03:21:09,390
Okay.

2865
03:21:10,610 --> 03:21:11,850
What now?

2866
03:21:13,130 --> 03:21:14,470
He's shaking.

2867
03:21:17,750 --> 03:21:19,330
He's having withdrawal symptoms.

2868
03:21:20,950 --> 03:21:23,010
It's like me trying to get off sugar.

2869
03:21:38,460 --> 03:21:41,100
By the way, I think I hit this guy as well with the potion.

2870
03:21:42,340 --> 03:21:43,420
Maybe I just have to wait.

2871
03:21:45,820 --> 03:21:48,140
Also, why do you have water here, sir?

2872
03:21:52,820 --> 03:21:53,680
You don't like that?

2873
03:21:55,080 --> 03:21:55,480
No?

2874
03:21:56,920 --> 03:21:57,620
Stop shaking!

2875
03:22:00,700 --> 03:22:01,520
No more shaking!

2876
03:22:02,620 --> 03:22:03,500
Do something!

2877
03:22:09,780 --> 03:22:10,980
Oh, you know what, actually?

2878
03:22:11,860 --> 03:22:16,500
While I'm down here... Block of iron!

2879
03:22:17,280 --> 03:22:19,200
I'm gonna make a thingy while I wait.

2880
03:22:19,680 --> 03:22:20,460
I think I have to wait.

2881
03:22:20,640 --> 03:22:21,220
Like, he's shaking.

2882
03:22:21,380 --> 03:22:22,400
Clearly something is going on.

2883
03:22:26,540 --> 03:22:33,540
Make me a... make me a... a thingy.

2884
03:22:33,720 --> 03:22:34,320
White carpet?

2885
03:22:34,440 --> 03:22:34,880
We don't need that.

2886
03:22:35,840 --> 03:22:37,340
In fact, this is the trash chest.

2887
03:22:37,740 --> 03:22:39,100
Everything we don't need goes in here.

2888
03:22:46,340 --> 03:22:46,840
Now.

2889
03:22:47,520 --> 03:22:48,020
Anvil.

2890
03:22:52,560 --> 03:22:52,980
BAM!

2891
03:22:53,180 --> 03:22:53,620
You heard that?

2892
03:22:54,160 --> 03:22:54,980
Okay, now?

2893
03:22:55,660 --> 03:23:01,760
Ah, wait, I need, uh... There.

2894
03:23:03,560 --> 03:23:03,980
What?

2895
03:23:06,560 --> 03:23:07,500
Because of the carpet.

2896
03:23:07,740 --> 03:23:09,180
That makes no fucking sense, but okay.

2897
03:23:13,270 --> 03:23:14,010
This one.

2898
03:23:15,710 --> 03:23:17,090
And here.

2899
03:23:20,090 --> 03:23:20,590
Eleven?!

2900
03:23:20,590 --> 03:23:21,430
Jesus.

2901
03:23:21,970 --> 03:23:23,630
Okay, but I guess it's worth it.

2902
03:23:24,070 --> 03:23:25,550
Now we can pretty much fly home.

2903
03:23:26,210 --> 03:23:27,090
Not bad, eh?

2904
03:23:27,610 --> 03:23:28,050
Not bad.

2905
03:23:32,610 --> 03:23:33,110
Motherfucker!

2906
03:23:34,310 --> 03:23:36,450
Also, this doesn't have any charge at all.

2907
03:23:40,260 --> 03:23:42,580
Put this back in my... this one.

2908
03:23:44,120 --> 03:23:45,860
Gold goes with my other gold.

2909
03:23:48,140 --> 03:23:49,860
Do you need to be let go or something?

2910
03:23:52,640 --> 03:23:53,320
Come out.

2911
03:23:57,500 --> 03:23:58,020
Oh!

2912
03:23:58,740 --> 03:24:00,300
He became a cleric.

2913
03:24:04,780 --> 03:24:05,500
Rotten flesh.

2914
03:24:07,940 --> 03:24:10,120
Dude, I have a lot of rotten flesh at home.

2915
03:24:10,200 --> 03:24:11,220
I actually need to make a cleric.

2916
03:24:15,200 --> 03:24:17,300
Are you gonna do something about this guy or what?

2917
03:24:25,690 --> 03:24:26,890
I don't know what to do.

2918
03:24:27,050 --> 03:24:27,570
I don't know what to do.

2919
03:24:27,970 --> 03:24:30,210
Weaken and then cure a zombie villager.

2920
03:24:31,770 --> 03:24:32,670
I did it, man.

2921
03:24:32,890 --> 03:24:33,550
I've done it.

2922
03:24:37,130 --> 03:24:37,910
What is this?

2923
03:24:44,330 --> 03:24:46,770
Oh, walk on powder snow without sinking in it.

2924
03:24:48,890 --> 03:24:49,770
How do I do that?

2925
03:24:50,570 --> 03:24:52,610
That would be very nice to do, actually.

2926
03:24:53,710 --> 03:24:56,270
50 out of 54 biomes, by the way.

2927
03:24:56,510 --> 03:24:57,330
Only 4 left.

2928
03:24:57,970 --> 03:24:59,950
That's going to be a crazy achievement when I hit that one.

2929
03:25:11,720 --> 03:25:12,280
I don't know.

2930
03:25:12,440 --> 03:25:12,940
I don't know.

2931
03:25:14,560 --> 03:25:15,800
I guess I'll just leave him to it.

2932
03:25:18,710 --> 03:25:20,470
No, no, no.

2933
03:25:21,030 --> 03:25:21,550
Put it back.

2934
03:25:22,650 --> 03:25:23,210
Give me that.

2935
03:25:24,990 --> 03:25:27,150
Put the elytra... No, actually, put it on.

2936
03:25:28,850 --> 03:25:32,210
And I need my... Yeah, I already got him.

2937
03:25:32,370 --> 03:25:32,750
No, good.

2938
03:25:33,750 --> 03:25:34,450
Don't need that.

2939
03:25:34,930 --> 03:25:35,650
You can have it.

2940
03:25:35,790 --> 03:25:36,250
You can have it.

2941
03:25:36,490 --> 03:25:37,110
You can have it.

2942
03:25:38,670 --> 03:25:39,330
Crafting table.

2943
03:25:39,990 --> 03:25:40,550
Put it in.

2944
03:25:42,150 --> 03:25:42,490
Oh!

2945
03:25:48,070 --> 03:25:48,570
Yay!

2946
03:25:51,930 --> 03:25:53,910
Okay, just took two and a half years.

2947
03:25:55,510 --> 03:25:56,010
Fantastic.

2948
03:25:56,810 --> 03:25:57,650
There it is.

2949
03:26:00,920 --> 03:26:01,480
Huh.

2950
03:26:02,200 --> 03:26:02,720
Weird.

2951
03:26:05,680 --> 03:26:07,460
Uh... Fuckin' na- Look!

2952
03:26:07,740 --> 03:26:09,140
All achievements, baby!

2953
03:26:09,700 --> 03:26:10,840
All of them.

2954
03:26:11,080 --> 03:26:12,460
In the Minecraft section.

2955
03:26:13,460 --> 03:26:14,380
Hashtag nailed.

2956
03:26:15,100 --> 03:26:16,020
I did it.

2957
03:26:18,260 --> 03:26:19,300
Let me get out of here.

2958
03:26:21,080 --> 03:26:22,180
Have fun, you two!

2959
03:26:22,500 --> 03:26:24,020
Don't do anything I wouldn't.

2960
03:26:25,100 --> 03:26:26,420
You're a leather worker, huh?

2961
03:26:27,080 --> 03:26:28,840
Wow, you're giving me good...

2962
03:26:29,080 --> 03:26:29,860
Traits here.

2963
03:26:30,800 --> 03:26:31,540
Look at that.

2964
03:26:31,740 --> 03:26:33,760
One emerald for leather pants.

2965
03:26:34,900 --> 03:26:35,380
Ooooo!

2966
03:26:37,040 --> 03:26:37,520
Yo!

2967
03:26:39,780 --> 03:26:40,760
That is huge!

2968
03:26:43,600 --> 03:26:44,920
I'll give you all my leather.

2969
03:26:46,920 --> 03:26:48,140
Hold on, hold on, hold on.

2970
03:26:48,180 --> 03:26:49,360
You can have everything.

2971
03:26:55,650 --> 03:26:58,770
Oh no, I can't do more.

2972
03:27:05,690 --> 03:27:07,590
Oh my god.

2973
03:27:07,910 --> 03:27:09,530
Is it because I cured you?

2974
03:27:09,670 --> 03:27:10,610
Are you that happy?

2975
03:27:11,490 --> 03:27:13,050
You're so happy.

2976
03:27:17,870 --> 03:27:18,810
Hey, listen.

2977
03:27:19,450 --> 03:27:21,210
My dude.

2978
03:27:25,960 --> 03:27:27,140
Don't worry about that sound, okay?

2979
03:27:27,300 --> 03:27:28,100
It's nothing to worry about.

2980
03:27:29,800 --> 03:27:31,060
You are coming with me.

2981
03:27:31,500 --> 03:27:34,960
You seem to be a good... person.

2982
03:27:35,960 --> 03:27:40,340
And you shall be rewarded... for what you have done to me today.

2983
03:27:42,740 --> 03:27:43,720
Get this shit in here.

2984
03:27:46,180 --> 03:27:48,400
Do you really not want to take any more leather from me?

2985
03:27:52,610 --> 03:27:54,350
I mean, dyed leather?

2986
03:27:54,910 --> 03:27:56,030
Looks kind of fancy.

2987
03:27:57,110 --> 03:27:58,430
I kind of want to level them up.

2988
03:28:01,150 --> 03:28:01,630
Nah.

2989
03:28:02,370 --> 03:28:03,570
I'm going to take you with me.

2990
03:28:03,990 --> 03:28:04,250
Question.

2991
03:28:04,570 --> 03:28:05,750
Can you follow me?

2992
03:28:06,070 --> 03:28:06,310
Whoops.

2993
03:28:06,830 --> 03:28:08,190
